{"id":"0b88ba4114f012c8","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-ricci-curvature.md","title":"Ricci Curvature","display":"df-ricci-curvature — Ricci Curvature","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-ricci-curvature","aliases":["58-df-ricci-curvature","Ricci Curvature"],"display":"df-ricci-curvature — Ricci Curvature","depends_on":["[[58-df-curvature]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-orthonormal-basis]]","[[58-df-riemannian-manifold]]","[[../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-covariant-derivative.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-connection.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-ricci-curvature"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-ricci-curvature</span><span>Ricci Curvature</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ricci-curvature — Ricci Curvature"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5cfc0a9f57224437\" href=\"?note=5cfc0a9f57224437\" title=\"58-df-curvature\">58-df-curvature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bb0e606138cd791a\" href=\"?note=bb0e606138cd791a\" title=\"58-df-orthonormal-basis\">58-df-orthonormal-basis</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" href=\"?note=04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" title=\"58-df-riemannian-manifold\">58-df-riemannian-manifold</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f810bf542334e0d1\" href=\"?note=f810bf542334e0d1\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md\">../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c5f44e08576c6b2e\" href=\"?note=c5f44e08576c6b2e\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md\">../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2ee05b1995ae05f1\" href=\"?note=2ee05b1995ae05f1\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-covariant-derivative.md\">../batch17/58-df-covariant-derivative.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"904b0609d7cbf868\" href=\"?note=904b0609d7cbf868\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-connection.md\">../batch11/58-df-connection.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\nabla,\\pi,E,g,R,e,\\rho,D,j\\in V\">\\(M,\\nabla,\\pi,E,g,R,e,\\rho,D,j\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=\\langle\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb R,S,r,A,O,\\mathcal T\\rangle\">\\(D=\\langle\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb R,S,r,A,O,\\mathcal T\\rangle\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\">\\(S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\\)</span> 是内部光滑向量丛和流形记录；以下每个记录的分量均取该记录的投影，非法记录使相关谓词为假。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(S,p)\">\\(T(S,p)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak X(S)\">\\(\\mathfrak X(S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma(D)\">\\(\\Gamma(D)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nabla_X^D s\">\\(\\nabla_X^D s\\)</span>、张量求值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g[\\langle X,Y\\rangle]\">\\(g[\\langle X,Y\\rangle]\\)</span>、导子括号和切向量逐点线性运算由依赖定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pr}_i\">\\(\\operatorname{pr}_i\\)</span> 是有限元组的第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 分量（从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 起）；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_{ij}\">\\(\\delta_{ij}\\)</span> 是 Kronecker 函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TangentBundleIso}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{TangentBundleIso}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeviCivitaConnection}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{LeviCivitaConnection}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PointwiseOrthonormalBasisChoice}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PointwiseOrthonormalBasisChoice}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RicciContraction}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{RicciContraction}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RicciCurvature}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RicciCurvature}_S\\)</span> 保留原元数。新添的 Data 接口显式绑定共同结构和丛同构。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MetricTensorData}\">\\(\\mathrm{MetricTensorData}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothTensorData}\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothTensorData}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c5f44e08576c6b2e\" href=\"?note=c5f44e08576c6b2e\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md\">../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CurvatureData}\">\\(\\mathrm{CurvatureData}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"904b0609d7cbf868\" href=\"?note=904b0609d7cbf868\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-connection.md\">../batch11/58-df-connection.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CovariantDerivativeData}\">\\(\\mathrm{CovariantDerivativeData}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"2ee05b1995ae05f1\" href=\"?note=2ee05b1995ae05f1\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-covariant-derivative.md\">../batch17/58-df-covariant-derivative.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"f810bf542334e0d1\" href=\"?note=f810bf542334e0d1\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md\">../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CurvaturePointValue}\">\\(\\mathrm{CurvaturePointValue}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeviCivitaData}\">\\(\\mathrm{LeviCivitaData}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PointwiseBasisData}\">\\(\\mathrm{PointwiseBasisData}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RicciContractionData}\">\\(\\mathrm{RicciContractionData}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RicciGeometryData}\">\\(\\mathrm{RicciGeometryData}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TangentBundleIsoData}\">\\(\\mathrm{TangentBundleIsoData}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}_{58}(S)\\to\nTT(S)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle p,v\\rangle:p\\in M\\land v\\in T(S,p)\\},\\\\\nj:E\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}TT(S)\\land s\\in E^M&amp;\\to\nJ_{D,j}(s)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle p,\\operatorname{pr}_1(j(s(p)))\\rangle:p\\in M\\},\\\\\nj:E\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}TT(S)\\land X\\in\\mathfrak X(S)&amp;\\to\nK_{D,j}(X)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle p,j^{-1}(\\langle p,X(p)\\rangle)\\rangle:p\\in M\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}_{58}(S)\\to\nTT(S)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle p,v\\rangle:p\\in M\\land v\\in T(S,p)\\},\\\\\nj:E\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}TT(S)\\land s\\in E^M&amp;\\to\nJ_{D,j}(s)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle p,\\operatorname{pr}_1(j(s(p)))\\rangle:p\\in M\\},\\\\\nj:E\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}TT(S)\\land X\\in\\mathfrak X(S)&amp;\\to\nK_{D,j}(X)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle p,j^{-1}(\\langle p,X(p)\\rangle)\\rangle:p\\in M\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TangentBundleIsoData}_{58}(j,D)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb R)\n\\land j:E\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}TT(S)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall u\\in E\\;\\operatorname{pr}_0(j(u))=\\pi(u)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall u,v\\in\\pi^{-1}[\\{p\\}]\\;\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\n\\operatorname{pr}_1(j(A(p)(O(p)(a,u),O(p)(b,v))))\n=a\\operatorname{pr}_1(j(u))+b\\operatorname{pr}_1(j(v))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s\\in\\Gamma(D)\\;J_{D,j}(s)\\in\\mathfrak X(S)\n\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathfrak X(S)\\;K_{D,j}(X)\\in\\Gamma(D).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TangentBundleIsoData}_{58}(j,D)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb R)\n\\land j:E\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}TT(S)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall u\\in E\\;\\operatorname{pr}_0(j(u))=\\pi(u)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall u,v\\in\\pi^{-1}[\\{p\\}]\\;\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\n\\operatorname{pr}_1(j(A(p)(O(p)(a,u),O(p)(b,v))))\n=a\\operatorname{pr}_1(j(u))+b\\operatorname{pr}_1(j(v))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s\\in\\Gamma(D)\\;J_{D,j}(s)\\in\\mathfrak X(S)\n\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathfrak X(S)\\;K_{D,j}(X)\\in\\Gamma(D).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TangentBundleIso}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\pi,E,M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists D,j\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\mathrm{TangentBundleIsoData}_{58}(j,D)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TangentBundleIso}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\pi,E,M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists D,j\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\mathrm{TangentBundleIsoData}_{58}(j,D)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LeviCivitaData}_{58}(\\nabla,g,D,j)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{TangentBundleIsoData}_{58}(j,D)\\land\\mathrm{MetricTensorData}_{58}(g,S)\n\\land\\mathrm{CovariantDerivativeData}_{58}(\\nabla,D)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X,Y,Z\\in\\mathfrak X(S)\\;\\forall p\\in M\\;\n2g(p)(\\langle J_{D,j}(\\nabla_X^D K_{D,j}(Y))(p),Z(p)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad=X[g[\\langle Y,Z\\rangle]](p)+Y[g[\\langle Z,X\\rangle]](p)-Z[g[\\langle X,Y\\rangle]](p)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\quad-g[\\langle X,[Y,Z]\\rangle](p)+g[\\langle Y,[Z,X]\\rangle](p)+g[\\langle Z,[X,Y]\\rangle](p).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LeviCivitaData}_{58}(\\nabla,g,D,j)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{TangentBundleIsoData}_{58}(j,D)\\land\\mathrm{MetricTensorData}_{58}(g,S)\n\\land\\mathrm{CovariantDerivativeData}_{58}(\\nabla,D)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X,Y,Z\\in\\mathfrak X(S)\\;\\forall p\\in M\\;\n2g(p)(\\langle J_{D,j}(\\nabla_X^D K_{D,j}(Y))(p),Z(p)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad=X[g[\\langle Y,Z\\rangle]](p)+Y[g[\\langle Z,X\\rangle]](p)-Z[g[\\langle X,Y\\rangle]](p)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\quad-g[\\langle X,[Y,Z]\\rangle](p)+g[\\langle Y,[Z,X]\\rangle](p)+g[\\langle Z,[X,Y]\\rangle](p).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LeviCivitaConnection}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\nabla;g,\\pi,E,M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists D,j\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\mathrm{LeviCivitaData}_{58}(\\nabla,g,D,j)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LeviCivitaConnection}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\nabla;g,\\pi,E,M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists D,j\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\mathrm{LeviCivitaData}_{58}(\\nabla,g,D,j)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PointwiseBasisData}_{58}(e,g,S,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{MetricTensorData}_{58}(g,S)\\land n=\\operatorname{pr}_3(S)\\land n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(e,M,\\operatorname{ran}(e))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\bigl[e(p)\\in T(S,p)^n\n\\land\\forall i,j\\in n\\;g(p)(\\langle e(p)(i),e(p)(j)\\rangle)=\\delta_{ij}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{21mm}\\land\\forall v\\in T(S,p)\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;\\forall f\\in C(S)\\;\nv(f)=\\sum_{i\\in n}c(i)e(p)(i)(f)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PointwiseBasisData}_{58}(e,g,S,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{MetricTensorData}_{58}(g,S)\\land n=\\operatorname{pr}_3(S)\\land n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(e,M,\\operatorname{ran}(e))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\bigl[e(p)\\in T(S,p)^n\n\\land\\forall i,j\\in n\\;g(p)(\\langle e(p)(i),e(p)(j)\\rangle)=\\delta_{ij}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{21mm}\\land\\forall v\\in T(S,p)\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;\\forall f\\in C(S)\\;\nv(f)=\\sum_{i\\in n}c(i)e(p)(i)(f)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PointwiseOrthonormalBasisChoice}_S(e;M,g,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau,\\mathcal A\\;\\mathrm{PointwiseBasisData}_{58}(e,g,\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle,n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PointwiseOrthonormalBasisChoice}_S(e;M,g,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau,\\mathcal A\\;\\mathrm{PointwiseBasisData}_{58}(e,g,\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle,n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CurvaturePointValue}_{58}(u;R,D,j,p,v,w,z)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{TangentBundleIsoData}_{58}(j,D)\\land p\\in M\\land u,v,w,z\\in T(S,p)\\\\\n&amp;\\land R\\in\\Gamma(D)^{\\mathfrak X(S)\\times\\mathfrak X(S)\\times\\Gamma(D)}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists X,Y,Z\\in\\mathfrak X(S)\\;(X(p)=v\\land Y(p)=w\\land Z(p)=z)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X,Y,Z\\in\\mathfrak X(S)\\;\n\\bigl((X(p)=v\\land Y(p)=w\\land Z(p)=z)\n\\to u=J_{D,j}(R(X,Y,K_{D,j}(Z)))(p)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CurvaturePointValue}_{58}(u;R,D,j,p,v,w,z)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{TangentBundleIsoData}_{58}(j,D)\\land p\\in M\\land u,v,w,z\\in T(S,p)\\\\\n&amp;\\land R\\in\\Gamma(D)^{\\mathfrak X(S)\\times\\mathfrak X(S)\\times\\Gamma(D)}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists X,Y,Z\\in\\mathfrak X(S)\\;(X(p)=v\\land Y(p)=w\\land Z(p)=z)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X,Y,Z\\in\\mathfrak X(S)\\;\n\\bigl((X(p)=v\\land Y(p)=w\\land Z(p)=z)\n\\to u=J_{D,j}(R(X,Y,K_{D,j}(Z)))(p)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RicciContractionData}_{58}(\\rho,R,g,e,n,D,j)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{TangentBundleIsoData}_{58}(j,D)\\land\\mathrm{PointwiseBasisData}_{58}(e,g,S,n)\n\\land\\mathrm{SmoothTensorData}_{58}(\\rho,S,2)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall v,w\\in T(S,p)\\;\n\\bigl[\\rho(p)(\\langle v,w\\rangle)=\\rho(p)(\\langle w,v\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\exists u\\in T(S,p)^n\\;\\bigl(\n\\forall i\\in n\\;\\mathrm{CurvaturePointValue}_{58}(u(i);R,D,j,p,e(p)(i),v,w)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{47mm}\\land\\rho(p)(\\langle v,w\\rangle)=\\sum_{i\\in n}g(p)(\\langle u(i),e(p)(i)\\rangle)\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RicciContractionData}_{58}(\\rho,R,g,e,n,D,j)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{TangentBundleIsoData}_{58}(j,D)\\land\\mathrm{PointwiseBasisData}_{58}(e,g,S,n)\n\\land\\mathrm{SmoothTensorData}_{58}(\\rho,S,2)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall v,w\\in T(S,p)\\;\n\\bigl[\\rho(p)(\\langle v,w\\rangle)=\\rho(p)(\\langle w,v\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\exists u\\in T(S,p)^n\\;\\bigl(\n\\forall i\\in n\\;\\mathrm{CurvaturePointValue}_{58}(u(i);R,D,j,p,e(p)(i),v,w)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{47mm}\\land\\rho(p)(\\langle v,w\\rangle)=\\sum_{i\\in n}g(p)(\\langle u(i),e(p)(i)\\rangle)\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RicciContraction}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\rho;R,M,g,e,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi,E,D,j\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\mathrm{RicciContractionData}_{58}(\\rho,R,g,e,n,D,j)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{RicciContraction}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\rho;R,M,g,e,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi,E,D,j\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\mathrm{RicciContractionData}_{58}(\\rho,R,g,e,n,D,j)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RicciGeometryData}_{58}(\\rho,R,\\nabla,g,e,n,D,j)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{LeviCivitaData}_{58}(\\nabla,g,D,j)\\land\\mathrm{CurvatureData}_{58}(R,\\nabla,D)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{RicciContractionData}_{58}(\\rho,R,g,e,n,D,j).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RicciGeometryData}_{58}(\\rho,R,\\nabla,g,e,n,D,j)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{LeviCivitaData}_{58}(\\nabla,g,D,j)\\land\\mathrm{CurvatureData}_{58}(R,\\nabla,D)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{RicciContractionData}_{58}(\\rho,R,g,e,n,D,j).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ricci\\text{-}curvature}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\quad\n\\mathrm{RicciCurvature}_S(\\rho;R,\\nabla,M,E,g,e,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi,D,j\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\mathrm{RicciGeometryData}_{58}(\\rho,R,\\nabla,g,e,n,D,j)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ricci\\text{-}curvature}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\quad\n\\mathrm{RicciCurvature}_S(\\rho;R,\\nabla,M,E,g,e,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi,D,j\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\mathrm{RicciGeometryData}_{58}(\\rho,R,\\nabla,g,e,n,D,j)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留曲率的原符号顺序及收缩号约定。用丛同构、Koszul 等式及从全局向量场确定的逐点曲率补足原先未定义的关系；所有组合条件共享同一结构记录。点态正交标架不要求随点光滑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Chow and Knopf, The Ricci Flow: An Introduction</li>\n<li>Besse, Einstein Manifolds</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-curvature","status":"resolved","id":"5cfc0a9f57224437","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-curvature]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-orthonormal-basis","status":"resolved","id":"bb0e606138cd791a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-orthonormal-basis]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-riemannian-manifold","status":"resolved","id":"04b9f5c6479b7ecd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-riemannian-manifold]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"f810bf542334e0d1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"c5f44e08576c6b2e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-covariant-derivative.md","status":"resolved","id":"2ee05b1995ae05f1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-covariant-derivative.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-connection.md","status":"resolved","id":"904b0609d7cbf868","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-connection.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"c5f44e08576c6b2e","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{MetricTensorData}$、$\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}$、$\\mathrm{SmoothTensorData}$ 取 [[../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-connection.md","status":"resolved","id":"904b0609d7cbf868","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{CurvatureData}$ 取 [[../batch11/58-df-connection.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-covariant-derivative.md","status":"resolved","id":"2ee05b1995ae05f1","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{CovariantDerivativeData}$ 取 [[../batch17/58-df-covariant-derivative.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"f810bf542334e0d1","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}$ 取 [[../batch17/58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\nabla,\\pi,E,g,R,e,\\rho,D,j\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"D=\\langle\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb R,S,r,A,O,\\mathcal T\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"T(S,p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak X(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma(D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\nabla_X^D s","display":false},{"tex":"g[\\langle X,Y\\rangle]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pr}_i","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_{ij}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TangentBundleIso}_{\\mathsf{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LeviCivitaConnection}_{\\mathsf{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PointwiseOrthonormalBasisChoice}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RicciContraction}_{\\mathsf{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RicciCurvature}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MetricTensorData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SmoothTensorData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CurvatureData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CovariantDerivativeData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CurvaturePointValue}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LeviCivitaData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PointwiseBasisData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RicciContractionData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RicciGeometryData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TangentBundleIsoData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}_{58}(S)\\to\nTT(S)&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle p,v\\rangle:p\\in M\\land v\\in T(S,p)\\},\\\\\nj:E\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}TT(S)\\land s\\in E^M&\\to\nJ_{D,j}(s)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle p,\\operatorname{pr}_1(j(s(p)))\\rangle:p\\in M\\},\\\\\nj:E\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}TT(S)\\land X\\in\\mathfrak X(S)&\\to\nK_{D,j}(X)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle p,j^{-1}(\\langle p,X(p)\\rangle)\\rangle:p\\in M\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TangentBundleIsoData}_{58}(j,D)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb R)\n\\land j:E\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}TT(S)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall u\\in E\\;\\operatorname{pr}_0(j(u))=\\pi(u)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall u,v\\in\\pi^{-1}[\\{p\\}]\\;\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\n\\operatorname{pr}_1(j(A(p)(O(p)(a,u),O(p)(b,v))))\n=a\\operatorname{pr}_1(j(u))+b\\operatorname{pr}_1(j(v))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall s\\in\\Gamma(D)\\;J_{D,j}(s)\\in\\mathfrak X(S)\n\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathfrak X(S)\\;K_{D,j}(X)\\in\\Gamma(D).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TangentBundleIso}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\pi,E,M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists D,j\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\mathrm{TangentBundleIsoData}_{58}(j,D)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LeviCivitaData}_{58}(\\nabla,g,D,j)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{TangentBundleIsoData}_{58}(j,D)\\land\\mathrm{MetricTensorData}_{58}(g,S)\n\\land\\mathrm{CovariantDerivativeData}_{58}(\\nabla,D)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall X,Y,Z\\in\\mathfrak X(S)\\;\\forall p\\in M\\;\n2g(p)(\\langle J_{D,j}(\\nabla_X^D K_{D,j}(Y))(p),Z(p)\\rangle)\\\\\n&\\qquad=X[g[\\langle Y,Z\\rangle]](p)+Y[g[\\langle Z,X\\rangle]](p)-Z[g[\\langle X,Y\\rangle]](p)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\quad-g[\\langle X,[Y,Z]\\rangle](p)+g[\\langle Y,[Z,X]\\rangle](p)+g[\\langle Z,[X,Y]\\rangle](p).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LeviCivitaConnection}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\nabla;g,\\pi,E,M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists D,j\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\mathrm{LeviCivitaData}_{58}(\\nabla,g,D,j)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PointwiseBasisData}_{58}(e,g,S,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{MetricTensorData}_{58}(g,S)\\land n=\\operatorname{pr}_3(S)\\land n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(e,M,\\operatorname{ran}(e))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\bigl[e(p)\\in T(S,p)^n\n\\land\\forall i,j\\in n\\;g(p)(\\langle e(p)(i),e(p)(j)\\rangle)=\\delta_{ij}\\\\\n&\\hspace{21mm}\\land\\forall v\\in T(S,p)\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;\\forall f\\in C(S)\\;\nv(f)=\\sum_{i\\in n}c(i)e(p)(i)(f)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PointwiseOrthonormalBasisChoice}_S(e;M,g,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau,\\mathcal A\\;\\mathrm{PointwiseBasisData}_{58}(e,g,\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle,n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CurvaturePointValue}_{58}(u;R,D,j,p,v,w,z)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{TangentBundleIsoData}_{58}(j,D)\\land p\\in M\\land u,v,w,z\\in T(S,p)\\\\\n&\\land R\\in\\Gamma(D)^{\\mathfrak X(S)\\times\\mathfrak X(S)\\times\\Gamma(D)}\\\\\n&\\land\\exists X,Y,Z\\in\\mathfrak X(S)\\;(X(p)=v\\land Y(p)=w\\land Z(p)=z)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall X,Y,Z\\in\\mathfrak X(S)\\;\n\\bigl((X(p)=v\\land Y(p)=w\\land Z(p)=z)\n\\to u=J_{D,j}(R(X,Y,K_{D,j}(Z)))(p)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RicciContractionData}_{58}(\\rho,R,g,e,n,D,j)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{TangentBundleIsoData}_{58}(j,D)\\land\\mathrm{PointwiseBasisData}_{58}(e,g,S,n)\n\\land\\mathrm{SmoothTensorData}_{58}(\\rho,S,2)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall v,w\\in T(S,p)\\;\n\\bigl[\\rho(p)(\\langle v,w\\rangle)=\\rho(p)(\\langle w,v\\rangle)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\exists u\\in T(S,p)^n\\;\\bigl(\n\\forall i\\in n\\;\\mathrm{CurvaturePointValue}_{58}(u(i);R,D,j,p,e(p)(i),v,w)\\\\\n&\\hspace{47mm}\\land\\rho(p)(\\langle v,w\\rangle)=\\sum_{i\\in n}g(p)(\\langle u(i),e(p)(i)\\rangle)\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RicciContraction}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\rho;R,M,g,e,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi,E,D,j\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\mathrm{RicciContractionData}_{58}(\\rho,R,g,e,n,D,j)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RicciGeometryData}_{58}(\\rho,R,\\nabla,g,e,n,D,j)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{LeviCivitaData}_{58}(\\nabla,g,D,j)\\land\\mathrm{CurvatureData}_{58}(R,\\nabla,D)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{RicciContractionData}_{58}(\\rho,R,g,e,n,D,j).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ricci\\text{-}curvature}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\quad\n\\mathrm{RicciCurvature}_S(\\rho;R,\\nabla,M,E,g,e,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi,D,j\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\mathrm{RicciGeometryData}_{58}(\\rho,R,\\nabla,g,e,n,D,j)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":7207,"backlinks":[{"id":"84333fc892f1be29","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2c7d1de20e312049","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{RicciGeometryData}$、$\\mathrm{TangentBundleIsoData}$ 取 [[../batch20/58-df-ricci-curvature.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"cd370570e5548030","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RicciCurvature}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch20/58-df-ricci-curvature.md]])"},{"id":"a56264a662b79511","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RicciCurvature}_S$ (pointwise tangent-bundle Ricci-curvature predicate, see [[58-df-ricci-curvature]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1090","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-ricci-curvature.md|58-df-ricci-curvature]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["5cfc0a9f57224437","36d7463d215be751","bb0e606138cd791a","04b9f5c6479b7ecd","f810bf542334e0d1","c5f44e08576c6b2e","2ee05b1995ae05f1","904b0609d7cbf868"]}